      "writtenOn": "2023-02-17T06:31:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "API guideline 6.6.7 : builders should not have getters\n\nhttps://g3doc.corp.google.com/company/teams/android-api-council/guidelines/index.md?cl\u003dhead#methods-prefer-collection-over-array\n\nGranted, this is not a public class and as such it\u0027s not strictly speaking subject to these guidelines, but it\u0027s still what all builders in Android look like in practice.\n\nSince this is an inner class, the parent can access the private member anyway. Java will generate a synthetic hidden accessor for this use.",
