      "message": "It is because I don\u0027t mock anything so networkSliceProperty is null\n```\nfinal PackageManager.Property networkSliceProperty \u003d packageManager.getProperty(\n                            PackageManager.PROPERTY_SELF_CERTIFIED_NETWORK_CAPABILITIES,\n                            callerPackageName\n                    );\n```\nso the following code will throw NPE\n```\nfinal XmlResourceParser parser \u003d packageManager\n                            .getResourcesForApplication(callerPackageName)\n                            .getXml(networkSliceProperty.getResourceId());\n```\n\nActually I feel this is a little bit confusing and the the enable flag logic already testes by all the other test case. \n\nI think we don\u0027t need to test it standalone so I removed it.",
